# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Every route below `/` is client-side. Without this, a hard refresh or a
# shared link to any path other than `/` asks Pages for a file that does not
# exist and gets a 404 — the app never boots. The 200 (rather than a 301)
# keeps the original URL in the address bar so the router can read it.
/*  /index.html  200
